<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Recoil</Major>
    <Description>An no-recoil script for all weapons for season 21. Set the macro on LMB and to hold only.
Resolution - 1920x1080 | I can't say the script will 100% work on other resolutions but I made a script that supports 4:3 resolutions.
Sensitivity - 1.5 in game with 1x scope on 1 multiplier / 2x scope on 1.1 multiplier and 4x scope on 1.3 multiplier.
Mouse Sensitivity - 800 or 1000 DPI
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 3 3
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 3 -3
Delay 20 ms
MoveR -3 -3
Delay 20 ms
MoveR -3 3
Delay 20 ms
GoWhile 1 10</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>